# The PS/2 keyboard and mouse controller, an 8042, as the firmware's ACPI tables describe it
# (PNP0303, the keyboard port; the mouse port, PNP0F13, gives its line too; docs/design/
# 0028-acpi.md, section 7).
class input
match acpi PNP0303
budget 1M
